### Login (create a user first: printf '%s\n' "$PASSWORD" | go run ./cmd/useradd -email you@example.com -name You)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"you@example.com","password":"change-me-please"}

### Current user (needs the session cookie from login)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/me

### Logout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout
